[Music]  I'm often asked this question of what  advice would I give to an aspiring  actress or actor the thing I do find  myself saying often is you should just  don't ever give up if acting is  something that you feel is in your veins  and in your DNA and and you just want to  do it and believe that you should and  believe that you can then if you keep  believing that enough and you keep  working hard because it's not going to  be handed you want to plate then that's  more important than anything else  determination and confidence will get  you everywhere especially when you walk  into an audition room because if you  walk into an audition room and you're  terrified and desperate then they'll  smell it on you and you're less likely  to get the job if you just believe in  yourself and you work hard and you walk  in there and bring confidence and good  positive energy with you you're much  more likely to get another looking I  live my life you know and every time I'm  cast in a film I am equally as terrified  as I was about the challenge when I did  my first film in seventeen and when I  did Titanic and when I did it turn on  sometime of the spotless mind and when I  did the reader you know that fear I  think is what drives me to be honest you  know acting it's such a wonderful thing  to do and I I I love it and I and I love  it more as I'm getting older I think but  it is scary because you can easily get  it wrong  five key traits to be successful I don't  know if I've really got five I mean I  think I would certainly say one of them  would be you know to work hard you know  because I do think that we live in a  time now where it's quite easy to get a  sort of full sense of celebrity or fame  and to aspire towards celebrity and fame  without even taking into account the  steps that you need to take to get to  achieve that thing I think it's making  young people lose that sense of work  ethic you know if you believe that  there's something you want to do and you  want to be successful at it it will not  just come to you you have to work  towards achieving that goal you know no  one else is going to achieve it for you  it's you've only got yourself to rely on  and I would say so self reliance really  determination confidence positivity and  staying healthy you know I think healthy  in your mind and in your body especially  at this time that we live in now where I  think there is a lot of pressure there's  a lot of exposure I think it's difficult  to be private for young people who  aren't even in the public eye just  children who are at school and hang on  to that sense of privacy because once  you give it away it's very very hard to  get back and just self-respect  I think those things are important  [Music]

